# Project-specific local files (existing rules)
exampleProblems/*
notes.md

# JavaScript / TypeScript: installed dependencies and build artefacts
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/.output/
**/.vite/
**/coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Rust build artefacts
**/target/

# Python caches and local virtual environments
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Temporary files, local logs and OS/editor artefacts
*.log
*.log.*
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Private local environment overrides 
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.test

